@lang en
IMPORT `vn11-art08-13-conditions`

-- Manulife Vietnam term life product terms, row VN-11: Article 14 (reinstatement), Article 15
-- (assignment), Article 16 (settling the death benefit), Article 17 (disputes) and Article 18
-- (termination). The regulative rule in Art 16 counts calendar days, from the day the claim is made.

§ `Article 14 — Reinstatement`

-- src:300 | đóng phí, Hợp đồng bảo hiểm có thể được khôi
-- src:301 | phục tùy theo sự xem xét của Công ty trong vòng
-- src:302 | 2 (hai) năm kể từ ngày chấm dứt Hợp đồng bảo
-- src:306 | Công ty chấp thuận và thanh toán tất cả các khoản
-- src:307 | phí bảo hiểm quá hạn cùng với lãi suất ở mức và
-- Only a contract that lapsed for non-payment in the grace period. Within two years from the day it
-- terminated, both ends inside (fork F2); the application's date stands for the reinstatement's
-- (fork F16). Evidence of insurability the Company accepts, and every overdue premium paid with
-- interest at a rate and in a manner the Company decides, within the State Bank of Vietnam's cap.
-- Even then reinstatement is "tùy theo sự xem xét của Công ty" (at the Company's discretion,
-- finding 7): the encoding says when the contract may be reinstated and records whether it was.
@ref Art 14, src:298-311
GIVEN `the application` IS AN `An application to reinstate`
GIVETH A DATE
`Art 14 — the last day to reinstate` `the application` MEANS
    `add years` (`the application`'s `date the contract terminated`) 2

@ref Art 14, src:298-311
GIVEN `the application` IS AN `An application to reinstate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 14 — the contract may be reinstated` `the application` MEANS
        `the application`'s `terminated for non-payment in the grace period`
    AND `the application`'s `date of the application` AT LEAST `the application`'s `date the contract terminated`
    AND `the application`'s `date of the application` AT MOST  `Art 14 — the last day to reinstate` `the application`
    AND `the application`'s `evidence of insurability accepted by the Company`
    AND `the application`'s `all overdue premiums paid with the interest the Company set`

@ref Art 14, src:298-302
GIVEN `the application` IS AN `An application to reinstate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 14 — the contract is reinstated` `the application` MEANS
        `Art 14 — the contract may be reinstated` `the application`
    AND `the application`'s `the Company agreed to reinstate`

§ `Article 15 — Assignment`

-- src:313 | Bên mua bảo hiểm có thể chuyển nhượng Hợp
-- src:314 | đồng bảo hiểm khi Người được bảo hiểm còn sống
@ref Art 15, src:313-315
GIVEN `the assignment` IS AN `An assignment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 15 — the policyholder may assign the contract` `the assignment` MEANS
        `the assignment`'s `the insured alive when it was made`
    AND `the assignment`'s `the contract in force when it was made`

-- src:322 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm thì người được chuyển
-- src:323 | nhượng sẽ tiếp nhận các quyền đó của Bên mua
-- The assignee takes the policyholder's rights on a lawful assignment of all of them; what else the
-- assignee takes is "tùy thuộc vào các điều khoản của việc chuyển nhượng", the assignment's terms.
@ref Art 15, src:316-324, 331-334
GIVEN `the assignment` IS AN `An assignment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 15 — the assignee takes the policyholder's rights` `the assignment` MEANS
        `Art 15 — the policyholder may assign the contract` `the assignment`
    AND `the assignment`'s `lawful and of all the policyholder's rights`

-- src:326 | nhượng trừ khi nhận được thông báo bằng văn bản
-- src:328 | nhượng gốc phải được nộp cho Công ty và được
-- src:329 | Công ty chấp thuận bằng văn bản. Công ty không
-- The Company is treated as not knowing of an assignment until all three are done. Its written
-- approval has no criteria (finding 7). Law 08/2022/QH15 Art 28(1) also asks, for life insurance,
-- for the insured's written consent (LAW fork L6).
@ref Art 15, src:325-331
GIVEN `the assignment` IS AN `An assignment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 15 — the Company is treated as knowing of the assignment` `the assignment` MEANS
        `the assignment`'s `written notice received by the Company`
    AND `the assignment`'s `original instrument submitted to the Company`
    AND `the assignment`'s `approved by the Company in writing`

§ `Article 16 — Settlement of the death benefit`

§§ `Art 16 — the evidence`

-- src:338 | quy định của Hợp đồng bảo hiểm khi Công ty
-- src:339 | nhận được các bằng chứng về tử vong của Người
-- src:344 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
-- src:348 | Hoàn chỉnh các mẫu đơn từ có liên quan do
-- src:351 | iii) Mối quan hệ của người hoặc những người
-- src:355 | Việc xảy ra sự kiện được bảo hiểm ghi ở
-- src:360 | Tuổi của Người được bảo hiểm (trừ khi đã
-- src:361 | nộp cho Công ty bằng chứng phù hợp về
@ref Art 16, src:337-362
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 16 — the Company has received the evidence it requires` `the claim` MEANS
        "proof of death" ... `the claim`'s `proof of death received`
    AND "(i)"            ... `the claim`'s `the contract provided`
    AND "(ii)"           ... `the claim`'s `the Company's forms completed`
    AND "(iii)"          ... `the claim`'s `evidence of the claimants' relationship provided`
    AND "(iv)"           ... `the claim`'s `evidence of the insured event provided`
    AND "(v)"            ... (`the claim`'s `evidence of the insured's Age provided` OR `the claim`'s `proof of age submitted earlier`)

§§ `Art 16 — the time to claim`

-- src:365 | hiểm theo Hợp đồng bảo hiểm là một năm hoặc
-- src:366 | một thời hạn khác theo quy định hiện hành của
-- src:367 | luật pháp kể từ ngày xảy ra sự kiện bảo hiểm. Thời
-- src:368 | gian xảy ra sự kiện bất khả kháng hoặc trở ngại
-- src:369 | khách quan khác không tính vào thời hạn yêu cầu
-- src:372 | được rằng Bên mua bảo hiểm không biết thời
-- src:373 | điểm xảy ra sự kiện bảo hiểm thì thời hạn quy định
-- src:374 | nói trên được tính từ ngày Bên mua bảo hiểm biết
-- One year from the insured event (the death), both ends inside (fork F2), plus the days lost to
-- force majeure or another objective obstacle. Where the policyholder proves not having known when
-- the event occurred, the year runs from the day the policyholder learned of it. Only the
-- policyholder can invoke this; a beneficiary who did not know cannot (finding 3). "hoặc một thời
-- hạn khác theo quy định hiện hành của luật pháp" points at the law; the Law of 2022 also says one
-- year (LAW fork L3).
@ref Art 16, src:364-375
GIVEN `the death` IS A `The death`
      `the claim` IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A DATE
`Art 16 — the last day to claim` `the death` `the claim` MEANS
    `add years` `the day the year runs from` 1 PLUS `the claim`'s `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle`
    WHERE
        `the day the year runs from` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the claim`'s `date the policyholder learned of the insured event`
            WHEN NOTHING          THEN `the death`'s `date of death`
            WHEN JUST `the day learned` THEN `the day learned`

@ref Art 16, src:364-375
GIVEN `the death` IS A `The death`
      `the claim` IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 16 — the claim was made in time` `the death` `the claim` MEANS
    `the claim`'s `date the claim was made` AT MOST `Art 16 — the last day to claim` `the death` `the claim`

§§ `Art 16 — paying the claim, and interest after two months`

-- src:379 | không được thanh toán sau 2 (hai) tháng kể từ
-- src:380 | ngày yêu cầu giải quyết quyền lợi bảo hiểm thì
-- src:381 | Công ty sẽ trả một khoản lãi tương đương mức lãi
-- src:382 | suất nợ quá hạn do Ngân hàng Nhà nước Việt
-- src:383 | Nam quy định. Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ chấm dứt
-- src:384 | sau khi đã giải quyết xong quyền lợi bảo hiểm của
-- "sẽ cố gắng giải quyết ngay" (will try to settle promptly) sets no deadline. The one the clause
-- gives is the two calendar months from the claim, after which interest at the State Bank of
-- Vietnam's overdue-debt rate is owed "for whatever reason" the claim was not paid (fork F17). So
-- the duty to pay is modelled with the two months as its deadline and the interest as the
-- reparation that follows, with no deadline of its own (phrasebook 5.6, 5.9). The duty arises only
-- where a death benefit is payable (vn11-death-claim.l4).
-- Law 08/2022/QH15 Art 31(1) gives 15 days from a complete claim where none is agreed (LAW fork L4).
@ref Art 16, src:376-383
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 16 — the days in the two months after the claim` `the claim` MEANS
    Day (`add months` (`the claim`'s `date the claim was made`) 2) MINUS Day (`the claim`'s `date the claim was made`)

@ref Art 16, src:376-383
GIVEN `the two months, in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act`
`Art 16 — the Company must pay the death benefit, with interest once two months have passed` `the two months, in days` MEANS
    PARTY  `the Company`
    MUST   `pay the death benefit`
    WITHIN `the two months, in days`
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   PARTY `the Company`
           MUST  `pay the death benefit with interest at the State Bank of Vietnam's overdue-debt rate`
           HENCE FULFILLED

@ref Art 16, src:379-383
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 16 names the State Bank of Vietnam's overdue-debt rate but not the period, the day count or the amount it applies to` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 16 names the State Bank of Vietnam's overdue-debt rate but not the period, the day count or the amount it applies to"

@ref Art 16, src:379-383
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 16 — the interest on a death benefit paid more than two months after the claim` MEANS
    `Art 16 names the State Bank of Vietnam's overdue-debt rate but not the period, the day count or the amount it applies to`

§ `Article 17 — Disputes`

-- src:387 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm được điều chỉnh và giải thích
-- src:388 | theo luật của nước Cộng hòa Xã hội chủ nghĩa
@ref Art 17, src:387-389
GIVETH A STRING
`Art 17 — the governing law` MEANS "the law of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam"

-- src:392 | đưa ra tòa án gần địa chỉ của Bên mua bảo hiểm
-- src:393 | nhất được ghi trong Đơn yêu cầu bảo hiểm, hoặc
-- src:394 | tại một tòa án do hai bên thống nhất lựa chọn.
-- Negotiation first; failing it, the court nearest the policyholder's address stated in the
-- application, or a court both parties choose.
@ref Art 17, src:390-394
GIVEN `the dispute` IS A `A dispute`
      `the form`    IS A `The application`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Art 17 — the courts the dispute may be taken to` `the dispute` `the form` MEANS
    IF   `the dispute`'s `settled by negotiation`
    THEN EMPTY
    ELSE CONSIDER `the dispute`'s `court chosen by both parties`
         WHEN NOTHING          THEN LIST `the nearest court`
         WHEN JUST `the court` THEN LIST `the nearest court`, `the court`
    WHERE
        `the nearest court` MEANS
            CONCAT "the court nearest to the policyholder's address stated in the application: ", `the form`'s `address of the policyholder stated in it`

-- src:395 | Thời hiệu khởi kiện của Hợp đồng bảo hiểm là 3
-- src:396 | (ba) năm hoặc một thời hạn khác theo quy định
-- src:397 | hiện hành của luật pháp, kể từ thời điểm phát sinh
-- Three years from when the dispute arose, both ends inside (fork F2); "hoặc một thời hạn khác
-- theo quy định hiện hành của luật pháp" again points at the law, and the Law of 2022 as given has
-- no limitation period of its own (LAW fork L8).
@ref Art 17, src:395-398
GIVEN `the dispute` IS A `A dispute`
GIVETH A DATE
`Art 17 — the last day to bring proceedings` `the dispute` MEANS
    `add years` (`the dispute`'s `date the dispute arose`) 3

§ `Article 18 — Termination`

-- src:400 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ chấm dứt vào một trong
-- src:401 | những thời điểm sau, tùy trường hợp nào xảy ra
-- src:403 | Khi Bên mua bảo hiểm không thanh toán phí
-- src:404 | bảo hiểm đến hạn sau thời gian gia hạn.
-- src:405 | ii) Ngày Người được bảo hiểm tử vong.
-- src:406 | iii) Ngày Hợp đồng bảo hiểm đáo hạn.
-- src:407 | iv) Khi Bên mua bảo hiểm yêu cầu chấm dứt
-- src:408 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
-- The earliest of four, in the order listed when two fall on one day. Each date is the day the
-- contract terminates as its limb words it: (i) the day after the last day of grace, (ii) the day of
-- death, (iii) the maturity date, (iv) the day of the request. Art 16 also ends the contract "after
-- the claim is settled", a second end for the same death (finding 11).
@ref Art 18, src:400-409; Art 5, src:159-161
GIVEN `the page`               IS A `The contract page`
      `the record`             IS A `The premium record`
      `the requests`           IS A `The policyholder's requests`
      `the day of death, if any` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `A termination under Art 18`
`Art 18 — the termination of the contract` `the page` `the record` `the requests` `the day of death, if any` MEANS
    `the earliest of` (`(iii)` FOLLOWED BY (`present` (LIST `(i)`, `(ii)`, `(iv)`)))
    WHERE
        `(i)` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the record`'s `instalment in default`
            WHEN NOTHING                THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST `the instalment` THEN
                IF   `Art 5 — the instalment was paid in full, to the Company or its agent, by` `the instalment` (`Art 5 — the last day of the grace period for` `the instalment`)
                THEN NOTHING
                ELSE JUST (`A termination under Art 18` OF (`Art 5 — the last day of the grace period for` `the instalment` PLUS 1), `(i) the premium due was not paid after the grace period`)
        `(ii)` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the day of death, if any`
            WHEN NOTHING        THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST `the day` THEN JUST (`A termination under Art 18` OF `the day`, `(ii) the insured died`)
        `(iii)` MEANS `A termination under Art 18` OF (`the page`'s `maturity date`), `(iii) the contract matured`
        `(iv)` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the requests`'s `date the policyholder requested termination`
            WHEN NOTHING        THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST `the day` THEN JUST (`A termination under Art 18` OF `the day`, `(iv) the policyholder requested termination`)

-- The earlier of two terminations; on the same day, the one listed first in Art 18.
GIVEN `the list` IS A LIST OF `A termination under Art 18`
GIVETH A `A termination under Art 18`
`the earliest of` `the list` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the list`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `Art 18 always has the maturity date`
    WHEN `the first` FOLLOWED BY `the rest` THEN foldl `the earlier of` `the first` `the rest`

GIVEN `a` IS A `A termination under Art 18`
      `b` IS A `A termination under Art 18`
GIVETH A `A termination under Art 18`
`the earlier of` `a` `b` MEANS
    IF   `b`'s `date` LESS THAN `a`'s `date`
    THEN `b`
    ELSE IF   `b`'s `date` EQUALS `a`'s `date` AND `the rank of` (`b`'s `ground`) LESS THAN `the rank of` (`a`'s `ground`)
         THEN `b`
         ELSE `a`

GIVEN `the ground` IS A `A ground of termination under Art 18`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the rank of` `the ground` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the ground`
    WHEN `(i) the premium due was not paid after the grace period` THEN 1
    WHEN `(ii) the insured died`                                   THEN 2
    WHEN `(iii) the contract matured`                              THEN 3
    WHEN `(iv) the policyholder requested termination`             THEN 4

GIVEN `the maybes` IS A LIST OF MAYBE `A termination under Art 18`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A termination under Art 18`
`present` `the maybes` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the maybes`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `the first` FOLLOWED BY `the rest` THEN
        CONSIDER `the first`
        WHEN NOTHING    THEN `present` `the rest`
        WHEN JUST `one` THEN `one` FOLLOWED BY `present` `the rest`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 18 always has the maturity date` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 18 always has the maturity date"
